        {
          "_name": "ma-articles",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            "direction": "rtl",
            ".ma-head": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "max-width": "720px",
              "margin": "0 auto 3rem"
            },
            ".ma-kicker": {
              "display": "inline-block",
              "color": "@mainColor",
              "font-weight": "700",
              "letter-spacing": ".08em",
              "margin-bottom": ".75rem"
            },
            ".ma-title": {
              "color": "@textColor",
              "margin-bottom": "1rem"
            },
            ".ma-sub": {
              "color": "#5b5446",
              "margin": "0"
            },
            ".ma-grid": {
              "display": "grid",
              "grid-template-columns": "1fr",
              "gap": "28px"
            },
            "@media (min-width: 768px)": {
              ".ma-grid": {
                "grid-template-columns": "repeat(2, 1fr)"
              }
            },
            "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
              ".ma-grid": {
                "grid-template-columns": "repeat(3, 1fr)"
              }
            },
            ".ma-card": {
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-direction": "column",
              "background": "#ffffff",
              "border-radius": "22px",
              "overflow": "hidden",
              "box-shadow": "0 18px 40px -24px rgba(58, 52, 28, .35)",
              "transition": "transform .35s ease, box-shadow .35s ease"
            },
            ".ma-card:hover": {
              "transform": "translateY(-6px)",
              "box-shadow": "0 28px 50px -24px rgba(58, 52, 28, .45)"
            },
            ".ma-card-img": {
              "display": "block",
              "aspect-ratio": "16 / 10",
              "overflow": "hidden"
            },
            ".ma-card-img img": {
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "object-fit": "cover",
              "border-radius": "0",
              "transition": "transform .6s ease"
            },
            ".ma-card:hover .ma-card-img img": {
              "transform": "scale(1.05)"
            },
            ".ma-card-body": {
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-direction": "column",
              "gap": ".75rem",
              "flex": "1",
              "padding": "24px 24px 28px"
            },
            ".ma-tag": {
              "align-self": "flex-start",
              "background": "rgba(183, 162, 132, .18)",
              "color": "#7a6648",
              "border-radius": "999px",
              "padding": "4px 14px",
              "font-size": ".95rem",
              "font-weight": "700"
            },
            ".ma-card-title": {
              "color": "@textColor",
              "margin": "0",
              "font-weight": "600"
            },
            ".ma-card-title a": {
              "color": "inherit",
              "text-decoration": "none"
            },
            ".ma-card-text": {
              "color": "#5b5446",
              "margin": "0",
              "flex": "1"
            },
            ".ma-more": {
              "color": "@mainColor",
              "font-weight": "700",
              "text-decoration": "none"
            },
            ".ma-more:hover": {
              "text-decoration": "underline"
            },
            ".mbr-section-btn": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "margin-top": "2.75rem"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              ".ma-grid": {
                "display": "flex",
                "overflow-x": "auto",
                "scroll-snap-type": "x mandatory",
                "gap": "16px",
                "padding": "4px 4px 18px",
                "margin": "0 -4px",
                "scrollbar-width": "none"
              },
              ".ma-card": {
                "flex": "0 0 82%",
                "scroll-snap-align": "center"
              },
              ".ma-head": {
                "margin-bottom": "1.6rem"
              }
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"ma-articles\" group=\"Custom\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n    <header>Content</header>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Articles\" name=\"cards\" min=\"1\" max=\"6\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Button\" name=\"showButton\" checked>\n    <header>Colors</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Main\" name=\"mainColor\" value=\"#9a8262\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Text\" name=\"textColor\" value=\"#3a341c\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"ma-head\">\n      <span class=\"ma-kicker mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-kicker\">מאמרים להורים</span>\n      <h2 class=\"ma-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-title\"><strong>ידע שעוזר לילד להצליח</strong></h2>\n      <p class=\"ma-sub mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-sub\">הסברים וטיפים מעשיים להורים, מתוך הניסיון שלנו במרכז למידה מא-ת.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ma-grid\">\n      <article class=\"ma-card\">\n        <a class=\"ma-card-img\" href=\"article-first-grade.html\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/service-first-grade.jpg\" alt=\"ילדה מתרגלת כתיבה לקראת כיתה א'\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n        <div class=\"ma-card-body\">\n          <span class=\"ma-tag\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-tag\">הכנה לכיתה א'</span>\n          <h3 class=\"ma-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-card-title\"><a href=\"article-first-grade.html\">המעבר מגן חובה לכיתה א'</a></h3>\n          <p class=\"ma-card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-card-text\">מה זה בעצם מוכנות לכיתה א', אילו סימנים כדאי לזהות, ואיך מכינים את הילד בבית ובמרכז הלמידה.</p>\n          <a class=\"ma-more mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" href=\"article-first-grade.html\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-more\">לקריאת המאמר &larr;</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ma-card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 1\">\n        <a class=\"ma-card-img\" href=\"article-middle-school.html\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/service-math-language.jpg\" alt=\"תלמידים לומדים מתמטיקה ושפה במרכז מא-ת\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n        <div class=\"ma-card-body\">\n          <span class=\"ma-tag\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-tag\">מעבר לחטיבה</span>\n          <h3 class=\"ma-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-card-title\"><a href=\"article-middle-school.html\">המעבר מיסודי לחטיבת ביניים</a></h3>\n          <p class=\"ma-card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-card-text\">מה משתנה בחטיבת הביניים, אילו מיומנויות כדאי לחזק כבר ביסודי, ואיך הורים יכולים לעזור.</p>\n          <a class=\"ma-more mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" href=\"article-middle-school.html\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-more\">לקריאת המאמר &larr;</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ma-card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 2\">\n        <a class=\"ma-card-img\" href=\"article-reading-fluency.html\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/service-reading-fluency.jpg\" alt=\"ילד מתרגל קריאה במרכז מא-ת\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n        <div class=\"ma-card-body\">\n          <span class=\"ma-tag\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-tag\">קריאה ולמידה</span>\n          <h3 class=\"ma-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-card-title\"><a href=\"article-reading-fluency.html\">דיוק ושטף בקריאה ואסטרטגיות למידה</a></h3>\n          <p class=\"ma-card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-card-text\">מה ההבדל בין דיוק לשטף בקריאה, ואילו אסטרטגיות עוזרות לילדים להצליח בשפה ובחשבון.</p>\n          <a class=\"ma-more mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" href=\"article-reading-fluency.html\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-more\">לקריאת המאמר &larr;</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ma-card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 3\">\n        <a class=\"ma-card-img\" href=\"articles.html\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/kit-01.jpg\" alt=\"מאמר חדש\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n        <div class=\"ma-card-body\">\n          <span class=\"ma-tag\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-tag\">נושא</span>\n          <h3 class=\"ma-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-card-title\"><a href=\"articles.html\">כותרת המאמר</a></h3>\n          <p class=\"ma-card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-card-text\">תקציר קצר של המאמר.</p>\n          <a class=\"ma-more mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" href=\"articles.html\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-more\">לקריאת המאמר &larr;</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ma-card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 4\">\n        <a class=\"ma-card-img\" href=\"articles.html\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/kit-01.jpg\" alt=\"מאמר חדש\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n        <div class=\"ma-card-body\">\n          <span class=\"ma-tag\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-tag\">נושא</span>\n          <h3 class=\"ma-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-card-title\"><a href=\"articles.html\">כותרת המאמר</a></h3>\n          <p class=\"ma-card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-card-text\">תקציר קצר של המאמר.</p>\n          <a class=\"ma-more mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" href=\"articles.html\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-more\">לקריאת המאמר &larr;</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ma-card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 5\">\n        <a class=\"ma-card-img\" href=\"articles.html\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/kit-01.jpg\" alt=\"מאמר חדש\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n        <div class=\"ma-card-body\">\n          <span class=\"ma-tag\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-tag\">נושא</span>\n          <h3 class=\"ma-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-card-title\"><a href=\"articles.html\">כותרת המאמר</a></h3>\n          <p class=\"ma-card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-card-text\">תקציר קצר של המאמר.</p>\n          <a class=\"ma-more mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" href=\"articles.html\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".ma-more\">לקריאת המאמר &larr;</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showButton\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"articles.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">לכל המאמרים</a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "ma-articles-29",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "v38AibNyyu",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "ma-faq",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            "direction": "rtl",
            ".ma-faq-wrap": {
              "display": "grid",
              "grid-template-columns": "1fr 1.6fr",
              "gap": "clamp(28px, 5vw, 64px)",
              "align-items": "start"
            },
            ".ma-kicker": {
              "display": "inline-block",
              "color": "@mainColor",
              "font-weight": "700",
              "letter-spacing": ".06em",
              "margin-bottom": ".6rem"
            },
            ".ma-faq-title": {
              "color": "@textColor",
              "margin-bottom": "1rem",
              "line-height": "1.15"
            },
            ".ma-faq-sub": {
              "color": "#5b5446",
              "margin-bottom": "1.4rem"
            },
            ".ma-faq-cta": {
              "display": "inline-block",
              "padding": "12px 24px",
              "border-radius": "999px",
              "color": "#ffffff !important",
              "font-weight": "600",
              "text-decoration": "none !important",
              "background": "linear-gradient(120deg, #8a7458, #b7a284)"
            },
            ".ma-faq-list": {
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-direction": "column",
              "gap": "12px"
            },
            ".ma-q": {
              "background": "#ffffff",
              "border-radius": "18px",
              "border": "1px solid rgba(154, 130, 98, .16)",
              "box-shadow": "0 14px 30px -26px rgba(58, 52, 28, .5)",
              "overflow": "hidden"
            },
            ".ma-q summary": {
              "list-style": "none",
              "cursor": "pointer",
              "padding": "18px 22px",
              "font-weight": "600",
              "color": "@textColor",
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "space-between",
              "align-items": "center",
              "gap": "16px"
            },
            ".ma-q summary::-webkit-details-marker": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".ma-q summary::after": {
              "content": "'+'",
              "flex": "none",
              "width": "30px",
              "height": "30px",
              "border-radius": "50%",
              "display": "inline-flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "background": "rgba(183, 162, 132, .18)",
              "color": "@mainColor",
              "font-size": "1.2rem",
              "transition": "transform .3s"
            },
            ".ma-q[open] summary::after": {
              "transform": "rotate(45deg)"
            },
            ".ma-q p": {
              "margin": "0",
              "padding": "0 22px 20px",
              "color": "#4a4434",
              "line-height": "1.75"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".ma-faq-wrap": {
                "grid-template-columns": "1fr"
              }
            },
            "background-image": "linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 110px, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) calc(100% - 110px), #ffffff 100%), url(\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\")",
            "background-size": "auto, cover",
            "background-position": "center"
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"ma-faq\" group=\"Custom\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n    <header>Colors</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Main\" name=\"mainColor\" value=\"#9a8262\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Text\" name=\"textColor\" value=\"#3a341c\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#f8f4ee\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"ma-faq-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"ma-faq-head\">\n        <span class=\"ma-kicker mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text>שאלות נפוצות</span>\n        <h2 class=\"ma-faq-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-text><strong>כל מה שהורים שואלים אותנו</strong></h2>\n        <p class=\"ma-faq-sub mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text>לא מצאתם תשובה? כתבו לנו ונשמח לעזור.</p>\n        <a class=\"ma-faq-cta\" href=\"index.html#form02-9\">לשיחת ייעוץ</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ma-faq-list\">\n        <details class=\"ma-q\" open><summary class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text>לאילו גילאים מתאים מרכז הלמידה?</summary><p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text>הכנה לכיתה א' מיועדת לילדי גן חובה. קבוצות דיוק ושטף בקריאה ובכתיבה מיועדות לכיתות א'-ג', וקורס מתמטיקה ושפה מיועד לכיתות ב'-ו'.</p></details>\n        <details class=\"ma-q\"><summary class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text>איפה המרכז נמצא?</summary><p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text>מרכז למידה מא-ת פועל במתנ\"ס הרוח היהודית בבאר שבע.</p></details>\n        <details class=\"ma-q\"><summary class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text>איך בנויה הלמידה במרכז?</summary><p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text>הלמידה מתקיימת בקבוצות קטנות. כל תלמיד מקבל תוכנית עבודה אישית לצמצום פערים, יחד עם חיזוק הביטחון העצמי והמוכנות הרגשית.</p></details>\n        <details class=\"ma-q\"><summary class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text>מי מלמדת במרכז?</summary><p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text>הדר נזרית-ראובן, בעלת תואר ראשון בחינוך מיוחד ו-15 שנות ניסיון בהוראה מתקנת.</p></details>\n        <details class=\"ma-q\"><summary class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text>אפשר לתרגל גם בבית?</summary><p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text>כן. ערכת ההכנה לכיתה א' של המרכז כוללת משחקים דידקטיים וחוברות פעילות בשפה ובחשבון לתרגול בבית.</p></details>\n        <details class=\"ma-q\"><summary class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text>איך מצטרפים?</summary><p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-text>משאירים פרטים בטופס באתר, מתקשרים ל-054-398-2557 או כותבים בוואטסאפ, ונחזור אליכם לשיחת ייעוץ.</p></details>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "faq",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vvVvjafrJF",
