את הכרטיס לקוד QR</span>\n          <span class=\"mc-to-front\">חזרה לצד הקדמי</span>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mc-panel\">\n        <p class=\"mc-eyebrow\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".mc-eyebrow\">מרכז למידה מא-ת</p>\n        <h1 class=\"mc-title\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".mc-title\">הדר נזרית-ראובן</h1>\n        <p class=\"mc-lead\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".mc-lead\">מורה להוראה מתקנת, 15 שנות ניסיון. הכנה לכיתה א', מתמטיקה ושפה, דיוק ושטף בקריאה. באר שבע.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"mc-actions\">\n          <a class=\"mc-act mc-act--primary\" href=\"tel:+972543982557\">\n            <span class=\"mc-ic\"><span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-phone mobi-mbri\"></span></span>\n            <span class=\"mc-act-text\"><span class=\"mc-act-title\">התקשרו</span><span class=\"mc-act-sub\" dir=\"ltr\">054-398-2557</span></span>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"mc-act mc-act--wa\" href=\"https://wa.me/972543982557\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n            <span class=\"mc-ic\"><span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon-whatsapp socicon\"></span></span>\n            <span class=\"mc-act-text\"><span class=\"mc-act-title\">WhatsApp</span><span class=\"mc-act-sub\" dir=\"ltr\">054-398-2557</span></span>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"mc-act\" href=\"mailto:hadar30484@walla.com\">\n            <span class=\"mc-ic\"><span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-letter mobi-mbri\"></span></span>\n            <span class=\"mc-act-text\"><span class=\"mc-act-title\">אימייל</span><span class=\"mc-act-sub\" dir=\"ltr\">hadar30484@walla.com</span></span>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"mc-act\" href=\"https://waze.com/ul?q=%D7%9E%D7%AA%D7%A0%22%D7%A1%20%D7%94%D7%A8%D7%95%D7%97%20%D7%94%D7%99%D7%94%D7%95%D7%93%D7%99%D7%AA%20%D7%91%D7%90%D7%A8%20%D7%A9%D7%91%D7%A2&amp;navigate=yes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n            <span class=\"mc-ic\"><span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-map-pin mobi-mbri\"></span></span>\n            <span class=\"mc-act-text\"><span class=\"mc-act-title\">ניווט ב-Waze</span><span class=\"mc-act-sub\">מתנ\"ס הרוח היהודית, באר שבע</span></span>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"mc-act\" href=\"index.html\">\n            <span class=\"mc-ic\"><span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-globe mobi-mbri\"></span></span>\n            <span class=\"mc-act-text\"><span class=\"mc-act-title\">לאתר</span><span class=\"mc-act-sub\" dir=\"ltr\">merkaz-lamida-a-t.com</span></span>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"mc-act\" href=\"index.html#form02-9\">\n            <span class=\"mc-ic\"><span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-edit mobi-mbri\"></span></span>\n            <span class=\"mc-act-text\"><span class=\"mc-act-title\">השאירו פרטים</span><span class=\"mc-act-sub\">ונחזור אליכם בהקדם</span></span>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"mc-act mc-act--primary\" href=\"hadar-nazrit-reuven.vcf\" download>\n            <span class=\"mc-ic\"><span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-user mobi-mbri\"></span></span>\n            <span class=\"mc-act-text\"><span class=\"mc-act-title\">שמירת איש קשר</span><span class=\"mc-act-sub\">הוספה לאנשי הקשר בטלפון</span></span>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"mc-act\" href=\"https://wa.me/?text=%D7%94%D7%93%D7%A8%20%D7%A0%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%99%D7%AA-%D7%A8%D7%90%D7%95%D7%91%D7%9F%2C%20%D7%9E%D7%A8%D7%9B%D7%96%20%D7%9C%D7%9E%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94%20%D7%9E%D7%90-%D7%AA%20%E2%80%93%20%D7%9B%D7%A8%D7%98%D7%99%D7%A1%20%D7%91%D7%99%D7%A7%D7%95%D7%A8%3A%20https%3A//merkaz-lamida-a-t.com/card.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n            <span class=\"mc-ic\"><span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-share mobi-mbri\"></span></span>\n            <span class=\"mc-act-text\"><span class=\"mc-act-title\">שיתוף הכרטיס</span><span class=\"mc-act-sub\">שליחה בוואטסאפ לחברים</span></span>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n\n        <h2 class=\"mc-sub\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".mc-sub\">מה אצלנו במרכז</h2>\n        <div class=\"mc-chips\">\n          <a href=\"workshops.html#timeline3-g\">הכנה לכיתה א'</a>\n          <a href=\"workshops.html#timeline3-y\">מתמטיקה ושפה (ב'-ו')</a>\n          <a href=\"workshops.html#timeline3-15\">דיוק ושטף בקריאה</a>\n          <a href=\"index.html#slider01-1s\">ערכת ההכנה לכיתה א'</a>\n          <a href=\"articles.html\">מאמרים להורים</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <h2 class=\"mc-sub\" mbr-text data-app-selector=\".mc-sub\">עקבו אחרינו</h2>\n        <div class=\"mc-social\">\n          <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/p/%D7%9E%D7%90-%D7%AA-%D7%9E%D7%A8%D7%9B%D7%96-%D7%9C%D7%9E%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94-%D7%91%D7%94%D7%A0%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%AA-%D7%94%D7%93%D7%A8-%D7%A0%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%99%D7%AA-%D7%A8%D7%90%D7%95%D7%91%D7%9F-100088353079240/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"מרכז למידה מא-ת בפייסבוק\"><span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon-facebook socicon\"></span></a>\n          <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/merkaz_lemida_a_t/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"מרכז למידה מא-ת באינסטגרם\"><span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon-instagram socicon\"></span></a>\n          <a href=\"mailto:hadar30484@walla.com\" aria-label=\"שליחת אימייל להדר\"><span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-letter mobi-mbri\"></span></a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
